<%# src/views/partials/badge-victory-mark.ejs — the task-badge win mark a
    ranked photo wears on its tile, bottom-left (issue #811; redesigned by
    issue #893, owner direction 2026-07-27): the tile shows the ACTUAL badge
    the guest won — its real icon and color via partials/badge-art — instead
    of the old generic trophy glyph. Rank 1 wears the badge with the gold
    ring; ranks 2-5 wear the plain badge.

    Locals:
      rank  (required) — the photo's task-badge placement (1 is gold).
      badge (required) — { name, art_path } of the badge actually won. %>
<%# role="img": a bare span maps to `generic`, whose author-name is
    prohibited — without the role a screen reader announces nothing
    (the #869 review's own fix in badge-art.ejs, applied here too). %>
<span class="tile-victory tile-victory-badge<%= Number(rank) === 1 ? ' tile-victory-gold' : '' %>"
      role="img"
      aria-label="<%= badge.name %> winner<%= Number(rank) === 1 ? ' — first place' : '' %>">
  <%- include('badge-art', { badge: badge, alt: '', imgClass: 'tile-victory-art', width: 16, height: 16 }) %>
</span>
